# Vulnerabilities accepted for this project.
# One CVE per line, each with a comment stating WHY it is accepted and who
# reviewed it. An entry without a justification is a finding, not a decision.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2016-1000027  # Spring HttpInvoker deserialisation - class not used by this
#                   # application, no fix available for the Spring 5.x / javax line.
#                   # Reviewed: 2026-07-28
